    e:['照片里的差异，有可量化的读数吗？','Can the differences in the photos be measured?', 'gross','c','用肺损伤评分核对','Check the lung injury scores'],
    f:['组织外观有变化，局部炎症也变了吗？','Does local inflammation change alongside tissue appearance?', 'markers','g','换一个炎症指标核对','Check a second marker'],
    g:['换一个信号蛋白，变化方向还一致吗？','Does a second inflammatory marker change in the same direction?', 'markers','h','看整只动物的状态','Check the animal’s overall condition'],
    h:['局部读数改善，动物整体状态怎样？','Do the local findings accompany better overall condition?', 'weight','i','直接看呼吸功能','Check respiratory function'],
